  {
   "id": "ccss-2013-reserva-5-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Estudie la derivabilidad de la función \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}e^x&\\text{si }x\\le0\\\\1&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\le3\\\\-x^2+6x+2&\\text{si }x\\gt3\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cada trozo es derivable en su intervalo. Estudiamos los puntos de unión; para ser derivable, primero tiene que ser continua<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si una función no es continua en un punto, tampoco es derivable en él.</i>.</p><p>• \\(x=0\\): \\(f(0)=e^0=1\\) y \\(\\lim_{x\\to0^+}1=1\\): continua. Derivadas laterales: \\(f'(0^-)=e^0=1\\) y \\(f'(0^+)=0\\): no derivable.</p><p>• \\(x=3\\): \\(f(3)=1\\) y \\(\\lim_{x\\to3^+}(-x^2+6x+2)=11\\): discontinua (salto finito), así que no es derivable.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 330 200' width='100%' style='max-width:340px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M11 170H325M140 177V16'/></g><text x='319' y='165'>x</text><text x='145' y='24'>y</text><g font-size='10' fill='currentColor'><line x1='56.0' y1='167.0' x2='56.0' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='56.0' y='184.0' text-anchor='middle'>-3</text><line x1='112.0' y1='167.0' x2='112.0' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='112.0' y='184.0' text-anchor='middle'>-1</text><line x1='168.0' y1='167.0' x2='168.0' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='168.0' y='184.0' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><line x1='224.0' y1='167.0' x2='224.0' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='224.0' y='184.0' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><line x1='280.0' y1='167.0' x2='280.0' y2='173.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='280.0' y='184.0' text-anchor='middle'>5</text><line x1='137.0' y1='159.0' x2='143.0' y2='159.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='162.0' text-anchor='end'>1</text><line x1='137.0' y1='115.0' x2='143.0' y2='115.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='118.0' text-anchor='end'>5</text><line x1='137.0' y1='49.0' x2='143.0' y2='49.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='52.0' text-anchor='end'>11</text></g><polyline points='19.6,169.9 22.6,169.8 25.6,169.8 28.6,169.8 31.6,169.8 34.7,169.7 37.7,169.7 40.7,169.7 43.7,169.6 46.7,169.6 49.7,169.6 52.7,169.5 55.7,169.5 58.7,169.4 61.7,169.3 64.8,169.3 67.8,169.2 70.8,169.1 73.8,169.0 76.8,168.8 79.8,168.7 82.8,168.6 85.8,168.4 88.8,168.2 91.8,168.0 94.9,167.8 97.9,167.6 100.9,167.3 103.9,167.0 106.9,166.6 109.9,166.2 112.9,165.8 115.9,165.3 118.9,164.8 121.9,164.2 125.0,163.6 128.0,162.8 131.0,162.0 134.0,161.1 137.0,160.1 140.0,159.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='140.0,159.0 154.0,159.0 168.0,159.0 182.0,159.0 196.0,159.0 210.0,159.0 224.0,159.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='224.0,49.0 226.3,49.1 228.6,49.3 230.9,49.7 233.2,50.2 235.6,50.9 237.9,51.7 240.2,52.7 242.5,53.8 244.8,55.1 247.1,56.5 249.4,58.1 251.7,59.8 254.0,61.7 256.3,63.7 258.7,65.8 261.0,68.2 263.3,70.6 265.6,73.3 267.9,76.0 270.2,78.9 272.5,82.0 274.8,85.2 277.1,88.6 279.4,92.1 281.8,95.8 284.1,99.6 286.4,103.6 288.7,107.7 291.0,112.0 293.3,116.4 295.6,121.0 297.9,125.7 300.2,130.5 302.5,135.5 304.9,140.7 307.2,146.0 309.5,151.5 311.8,157.1 314.1,162.9 316.4,168.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='224.0' cy='159.0' r='3.3' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='230.0' y='151.0' font-weight='700'>(3, 1)</text><circle cx='224.0' cy='49.0' r='3.3' fill='white' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='164.0' y='39.0' font-weight='700'>(3, 11) no incluido</text><circle cx='140.0' cy='159.0' r='3.3' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='104.0' y='153.0' font-weight='700'>(0, 1)</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(f\\) es derivable en \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0,3\\}\\)</div></div>"
    }
